{"kind":"assert","text":"Planner survey 08:30 EST, 4 November\n\nMain and origin match at c44e311c, and the shared checkout is clean. All three Workers stay on bcf88654 with hosted MCP closed. dap-connect serves f3064f99 closed. The mini serves celld 0fb0960fcd57a16d.\n\nThe card history fix 1c7dddfb is in review at 88ca47d3 (725346a8). The unchanged source fails its named late-reply case because the bridge discards the timed-out original. The fix keeps TOOL_WAIT_MS at 120000, retains only interested originals within the existing 32-request bound, and signals one callback on a matching late reply without repeating the call. After it lands I deploy it to dap-connect before the live window.\n\nHugh approved one finding from baa75642, and I filed it as 0ca13069: expected refusals in tests name the check that refused them, with the all-actions grant default made explicit. It follows 1c7dddfb, ahead of fd0cec33.\n\nO4 still waits on the builder's browser connection for the @o4-member join (c7a090dc). No builder question waits on me, and the builder holds more than three open items, so I file nothing else.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}